  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Solving, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0050_271532c312fa.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 209px;\"/></p><p>So, the required area is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>76</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>304</mn></math></p>"
